      "id": "L1.U16.S01",
      "text": {
        "hi": "ये आवाज़ें बोलते समय मुँह एक जगह से दूसरी जगह फिसलता है: igh, ow, oy.",
        "hinglish": "Yeh awaazein bolte samay munh ek jagah se doosri jagah phisalta hai: igh, ow, oy.",
        "en": "In these sounds your mouth glides from one place to another: igh, ow, oy."
      }
    },
