      "hint": "आइ",
      "text": {
        "hi": "‘igh’ की आवाज़ है: आइ, जैसे light में। ‘ie’ भी ऐसे ही बोलता है: tie.",
        "hinglish": "‘igh’ ki awaaz hai: aai, jaise light mein. ‘ie’ bhi aise hi bolta hai: tie.",
        "en": "‘igh’ sounds like the word ‘eye’, as in light. ‘ie’ sounds the same: tie."
      },
      "example": {
